{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's evaluate the two sigma expressions and see which of them results in $5 + (-7) + (-27) + (-55)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^4\\left(9-4k^2\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[9-4(1)^2\\right]+\\left[9-4(2)^2\\right]+\\left[9-4(3)^2\\right]+\\left[9-4(4)^2\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5 + (-7) + (-27) + (-55)\n\\end{align}$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^4\\left(2k+3)(3-2k\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=(2\\!\\cdot\\!1 \\!+\\!3)(3 \\!-\\! 2 \\!\\cdot\\! 1) \\!+\\! (2\\!\\cdot\\!2 \\!+\\! 3)(3 \\!-\\! 2\\!\\cdot\\!2) \\!+\\!(2\\!\\cdot\\!3 \\!+\\! 3)(3 \\!-\\! 2\\!\\cdot\\!3) \\!+\\! (2\\!\\cdot\\!4 \\!+\\! 3)(3 \\!-\\! 2\\!\\cdot\\!4)\n\\\\\\\\\u0026=5 + (-7) + (-27) + (-55)\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, both $\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^4\\left(9-4k^2\\right)$ and $\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^4\\left(2k+3)(3-2k\\right)$ are equal to $5 + (-7) + (-27) + (-55)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Consider the sum $5 + (-7) + (-27) + (-55)$.\n\n**Which expression is equal to the above sum?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^4\\left(9-4k^2\\right)$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^4\\left(2k+3)(3-2k\\right)$","correct":true},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
